                     "topFinding":  "The BLOCK is clear for the first time in seventeen runs: every anchor into the two gated mirrors now resolves to a client-gated design page, the gate phrase is out of the tracked handler, and the homepage hero counts derive from the card grid at index.html:2329. Twenty-eight HIGH and MEDIUM findings closed against the previous run and health rose 64 to 75. The verdict stays needs-attention for a wholly different reason: the release pipeline is blocked right now. check-status-json.ps1 exits 1 on dashboard/data/queue.json, which carries a double-encoded em dash at byte 3145, and release.ps1:22 aborts on that exit code, so scripts/release.ps1 cannot ship today. The cause is one unencoded read at collect-usage.ps1:818, which pipes .work-queue.json through Get-Content with no -Encoding utf8 and lets PowerShell 5.1\u0027s cp1252 default mangle every non-ASCII character into the published snapshot. Fix that line, repair the one string, and the release unblocks; the guard shipped yesterday is working exactly as designed.",
